1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,300
D2.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:07,845
Read Amy's proposal on protecting the ocean.

3
00:00:07,845 --> 00:00:17,580
Dear Sir or Madam, I am writing today to ask for your help in protecting the ocean.

4
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:22,460
The ocean is home to many kinds of sea life.

5
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:28,160
It provides us with food and offers us space to have fun.

6
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:33,240
However, the ocean is facing many problems.

7
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:37,000
Pollution is one of the biggest problems.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,680
There are millions of tons of plastic waste in the ocean.

9
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:50,960
Also, waste water from factories and houses travels to the ocean and causes pollution.

10
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:56,290
This will harm or even kill sea life.

11
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:59,840
We can help solve the problems.

12
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:06,690
We should keep beaches clean and use more environment-friendly products.

13
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:13,160
It is also a good idea to tell people how to protect the ocean.

14
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:16,920
We can also encourage them to help.

15
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:23,590
It is meaningful to join an environmental group and workers a volunteer.

16
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:25,910
Please join us.

17
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:29,540
Together, we can help protect the ocean.

18
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:32,690
With kind thanks, Zhao Min.
